","stars":5.0,"review_count":11,"categories":["Specialty Food","Ice Cream & Frozen Yogurt","Food","Grocery"],"is_open":true},"evidence":{"source":"frozen-model","summary":{"business_id":"c1Gg_GLbDOuQ52UKeTpqwg","user_id":"D76EFdD5F7XoIIyQmWTQhA","user_row":3279,"nv_rank":1333,"mm_rank":1560,"target_category_support_fraction":0.25,"selected_image_count":5,"label_diversity":2,"target_visual_score_gain":null,"target_visual_rank_gain":null,"competitive_visual_rank_effect":null},"category_overlap":[{"category":"Specialty Food","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Ice Cream & Frozen Yogurt","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3},{"category":"Grocery","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"c1Gg_GLbDOuQ52UKeTpqwg","review_id":"Ofn3KQWEdOb5MkVYHtpcqw","date":"2017-01-13T15:44:32","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9488623142242432,"text_excerpt":"New Orleans Ice Cream Company has some pretty nifty local themed and often sourced flavors of premium ice cream. This brand can be a bit of a challenge to find and so far I have only seen it at local groceries like Rouse's, Zara's, Langenstein's, Dorignac's, Breaux Mart, Fresh Market, Winn-Dixie and Whole Foods. Their Po Boy Ice Cream sandwich is probably the finest ice cream sandwich I have ever had and I believe Parkway Bakery offers those also. I first tried their ice cream at a Yelp event and I have been a fan ever since. This stuff has to be really good to occasionally break me away from my normal Creole Creamery and Angelo Brocato's addiction."},{"business_id":"c1Gg_GLbDOuQ52UKeTpqwg","review_id":"QDpobE8P6Lqg30j1DTGeRA","date":"2016-10-17T17:47:57","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9428880214691162,"text_excerpt":"Pretty good ice cream with some unique New Orleans flavors. I tried the coffee and chicory which was quite similar to other coffee ice cream I've had but slightly different. I can't really explain it, but I enjoyed it. Interesting that people I talked to in the French Quarter at various stores had never even heard of it... finally got some at Rouses."},{"business_id":"c1Gg_GLbDOuQ52UKeTpqwg","review_id":"sKxz3Is08Hx1KRqGwRzNkg","date":"2015-06-26T13:54:45","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9159015417098999,"text_excerpt":"Here's why five stars, I purchased a container of ice cream and found it was not to my satisfaction. When I sent a message regarding this the management went all out in answering my concerns and responding to the mix up... This showed the most excellent management and customer service practices, which is rare! What a nice company and a tasty product, something worthy of bearing the fleur de lis and the NOLA name! It's good ice cream!!!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"c1Gg_GLbDOuQ52UKeTpqwg","photo_id":"xAMkngIU2VoU3q3rlddP4w",